#: docs/design/usb-device.md:1
msgid "USB Device、Host 与显式角色所有权"
msgstr "USB Device, Host and explicit role ownership"

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:3
msgid ""
"公共接口是 `nexus/io/usb_device.h`。生产实现归属 `soc/stm32/stm32f4/`， 当前精确适配 STM32F"
"407VET6／ZGT6 的 OTG FS 与 HS core：内置 PHY 的全速、 外部 ULPI 的高速／全速回退，以及 PIO 和 HS"
" AHB DMA。Host 使用锁定官方 HCD／LL， Device 复用已有控制阶段与 errata IP owner。 目录按 STM32"
"F4 家族组织，不表示该系列全部器件已完成接入。Native 位于 `tests/support/native/`，仅作为显式启用的主机测试模型"
"。维护范围是 EP0 control、显式选择的非零 bulk／interrupt／ISO IN/OUT、 SETUP/reset/suspen"
"d/resume 事实、合法类型的 STALL、SET_ADDRESS、取消与退出。 DCD 的一次 request 仍是一个不超过 MPS 的"
"包；非零 endpoint 的 active／mask 由 独立可选 activation face 显式控制。SET_CONFIGURATIO"
"N、配置就绪及其回滚由外部 Chapter 9 owner 负责，packet 机制不能单独证明完整枚举／物理 reset 恢复。 可选 `Ne"
"xus::USBControl` 组合 EP0 多包 DATA、必要 ZLP 与 STATUS；独立的 `Nexus::USBDescripto"
"rs` 校验外部描述符结构。两者不创建任务或分配内存。 具体 class 分派、描述符字节与查找、VID/PID、字符串、配置及恢复策略由外部工"
"程提供。 可选 `Nexus::USBACM` 只组合下述 CDC ACM 控制子集；没有数据泵或完整 CDC/HID 类栈， 其合同不建立完整"
" class 栈；Device ISO 使用下述有限 packet 合同，远程唤醒由独立的 调用者请求和显式 service 推进。 独立的 `"
"nexus/io/usb_host.h` 提供 Host packet transport， `nexus/io/usb_otg.h` 提供按需"
"显式 managed role；自动 ID、SRP、HNP 策略不在范围内。"
msgstr ""
"The public interface is `nexus/io/usb_device.h`. Production implementati"
"on belongs to `soc/stm32/stm32f4/`, currently adapting the OTG FS and HS"
" cores of the exact STM32F407VET6/ZGT6 parts: full speed with an interna"
"l PHY, high speed with external ULPI and full-speed fallback, and PIO or"
" HS AHB DMA. Host uses the pinned official HCD/LL; Device reuses the exi"
"sting control-stage machinery and errata IP owner. Organizing directorie"
"s by STM32F4 family does not mean every device in that series is integra"
"ted. Native resides in `tests/support/native/` solely as an explicitly e"
"nabled host-test model. Maintained scope covers EP0 control, explicitly "
"selected nonzero bulk/interrupt/ISO IN/OUT endpoints, SETUP/reset/suspen"
"d/resume facts, STALL for applicable types, SET_ADDRESS, cancellation an"
"d shutdown. One DCD request remains one packet no larger than MPS. A sep"
"arate optional activation face explicitly controls nonzero endpoint acti"
"ve/mask state. An external Chapter 9 owner handles SET_CONFIGURATION, co"
"nfiguration readiness and rollback. Packet mechanisms alone cannot prove"
" complete enumeration or physical-reset recovery. Optional `Nexus::USBCo"
"ntrol` composes EP0 multipacket DATA, required ZLP and STATUS; separate "
"`Nexus::USBDescriptors` checks external descriptor structure. Neither cr"
"eates tasks nor allocates memory. External projects supply concrete clas"
"s dispatch, descriptor bytes/lookup, VID/PID, strings, configuration and"
" recovery policy. Optional `Nexus::USBACM` composes only the CDC ACM con"
"trol subset described below; it supplies no data pump or complete CDC/HI"
"D class stack, and its contract does not establish a complete class stac"
"k. Device ISO is supplied through the finite packet contract below; remo"
"te wake is driven by a separate caller-owned request and explicit servic"
"e. Separate `nexus/io/usb_host.h` provides Host packet transport, and `n"
"exus/io/usb_otg.h` provides optional explicitly managed roles. Automatic"
" ID, SRP and HNP policy are outside the scope."

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:23
msgid "对象、资源与时钟"
msgstr "Objects, resources and clocks"

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:25
msgid "controller 和 endpoint 保持独立 identity；公共 face 只有 readonly ops 与 context。 装配拥有一个 controller、精确 endpoint 数组、精确事件环和所选 PHY／controller clock owner。实例共享只读方法表，没有全局可变 registry、endpoint 最大池、隐藏 worker 或必选 OS。未选实例不产生状态，MCU 热路径用 direct volatile MMIO。模型编译只 替换外部 MMIO/NVIC 叶端口，MCU 不携带模型函数表或运行时模拟分支。"
msgstr "Controller and endpoint retain separate identities; public faces contain only read-only ops and context. Assembly owns one controller, an exact endpoint array and event ring, and the selected PHY/controller clock owner. Instances share read-only method tables without global mutable registries, maximum endpoint pools, hidden workers or mandatory OS. Unselected instances create no state, and MCU hot paths use direct volatile MMIO. Model builds replace only external MMIO/NVIC leaves; MCUs carry no model-function tables or runtime-simulation branches."

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:31
msgid "STM32F407 的 OTG_FS 基址是 `0x50000000`，四个 IN / 四个 OUT 方向、320-word FIFO， 单一 IRQ 67；绑定用锁定 SDK 验证实际 offset、stride、容量和 W1C/只读位。 OTG_HS 基址是 `0x40040000`，六个 IN／六个 OUT、1024-word FIFO、IRQ 77。 内置 FS PHY 使用 PB14／PB15 AF12；ULPI 使用十二根 AF10 pad 和外部 60 MHz。 EP0 固定 64-byte MPS；全速 bulk 为 8/16/32/64，高速 bulk 为 512。 全速 interrupt IN/OUT 为 1–64 B，高速为 1–1024 B。ISO 的协议 MPS 上界为 全速 1023 B、高速 1024 B，每次机会只支持一个 transaction，实际选择还须通过 FIFO 准入。 RX FIFO 采用审核下限 48 words，不自动改变既有默认；FS core 的 RXFD 上限为 256 words， HS core 为 1024 words； 总 FIFO 容量不能当作 RX 上限。每个选中及低编号未选 IN FIFO 至少留 16 words， HS AHB DMA 另留 32 words。完整 TX 分区由 controller 验证无重叠且不超总容量， 非法方向、类型、MPS、FIFO 和重复 identity 在 clock validate／retain 与 MMIO 之前拒绝。"
msgstr "STM32F407 OTG_FS starts at `0x50000000`, with four IN/four OUT directions, a 320-word FIFO and IRQ 67. Binding checks actual offsets, stride, capacity and W1C/read-only bits against the pinned SDK. OTG_HS starts at `0x40040000`, with six IN/six OUT directions, a 1024-word FIFO and IRQ 77. The internal FS PHY uses PB14/PB15 AF12; ULPI uses twelve AF10 pads and an external 60 MHz clock. EP0 fixes MPS at 64 bytes; full-speed bulk uses 8/16/32/64 bytes and high-speed bulk uses 512. Full-speed interrupt IN/OUT uses 1–64 B, high-speed 1–1024 B. ISO protocol MPS limits are 1023 B at full speed and 1024 B at high speed, one transaction per opportunity; each actual selection must also pass FIFO admission. RX uses a reviewed minimum of 48 words without changing existing defaults. The FS core RXFD maximum is 256 words and the HS core maximum is 1024; total FIFO capacity is not an RX limit. Each selected IN FIFO and each lower-numbered unselected IN FIFO reserves at least 16 words; HS AHB DMA reserves another 32 words. The controller validates the complete TX partition for overlap and total capacity. Invalid direction, type, MPS, FIFO or duplicate identity rejects before clock validate/retain or MMIO."

#: docs/design/usb-device.md:44
msgid "RX 还须覆盖 SETUP/status 与最大 OUT packet；多个 ISO OUT 至少保留两份最大 OUT packet 及其状态字空间。配置器、公开 profile 的 RX 检查和 C 准入使用同一需求。 FS core 的最大 ISO IN 参考为 48 RX＋16 EP0 TX＋256 ISO TX＝320 words。 whole-packet FS core OUT 1023 B 需要 270 RX words，超过 RXFD 上限而拒绝； HS core 的内置 PHY 全速模式可用足够 RX 接纳该 MPS。这是精确资源组合，不是所有 MPS／endpoint 组合均可装配的承诺。"
msgstr "RX must also cover SETUP/status and the largest OUT packet. Multiple ISO OUT directions reserve at least two largest-OUT packets and their status words. The configurator, public-profile RX checks and C admission use the same requirement. The maximum ISO IN reference on the FS core uses 48 RX + 16 EP0 TX + 256 ISO TX = 320 words. A whole-packet 1023 B OUT on the FS core requires 270 RX words, exceeding RXFD and therefore rejecting. The HS core with its internal PHY at full speed can admit that MPS with enough RX space. These are exact resource combinations, not a promise that every MPS/endpoint combination can be assembled."

